        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "……お前さんは、数字で切り捨てずに、俺の話まで聞こうとしているのだな。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "(数字だけで分かった気にならないようにしよう。本人が続けられる働き方を、一緒に考えるんだ。)",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          }
